# FastAPI server rules

## Structure

- `app/main.py` — app factory only
- `app/api/` — thin route handlers
- `app/models/` — SQLAlchemy + Pydantic schemas
- `app/workers/` — Celery tasks
- `app/services/` — business logic (when added)

## Rules

- Async routes and async SQLAlchemy (`asyncpg`)
- Settings via `pydantic-settings` from env — never hardcode secrets
- Alembic for all schema migrations
- API key auth on non-health endpoints
- Delegate to services — no business logic in route handlers

## Testing

- `httpx.AsyncClient` or `TestClient` for route tests
- Mock Celery tasks in unit tests; integration tests marked explicitly
